 in full by wire, for $7,505.15. The payment ID is PAY0001 and its status is \"sent.\"\n\nThe vendor (V-566) has wire and ACH enabled and is bank-verified, so I didn't need the ACH fallback. The amount is under the $10,000 threshold, so no controller approval was required. I sent the wire once, using an idempotency key, so it can't be executed twice.\n\nEvergreen's other invoices were left alone: INV-90500 ($1,847.72) is still a draft awaiting approval, and INV-93712 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}